@host = http://localhost:5258
@base = {{host}}/api/v1/orders

### 1) Geçerli sipariş (201 + Location + X-Correlation-ID)
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: test-abc-123

{
  "customerId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222", "productName": "Kalem", "quantity": 5, "unitPrice": 30 }
  ]
}

### 2) 50 TL altı sipariş (422 + traceId, loglarda Warning)
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222", "productName": "Silgi", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 10 }
  ]
}

### 3) KABUL KRİTERİ: filtre + sıralama + sayfalama
GET {{base}}?status=Pending&sortBy=totalAmount&sortDirection=desc&pageNumber=1&pageSize=5

### 4) KABUL KRİTERİ: whitelist dışı alan -> 400
GET {{base}}?sortBy=hackedField

### 5) Olmayan sipariş -> 404 (header'da yine X-Correlation-ID olmalı)
GET {{base}}/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000